## Tech Stack

| Technology | Version | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| Next.js API Routes | 14+ (App Router) | Server-side API endpoints |
| Razorpay Node SDK | Latest | Order creation, signature verification |
| @supabase/supabase-js | Latest | Server-side DB operations (service role) |
| @supabase/auth-helpers-nextjs | Latest | Session validation for admin routes |
| crypto (Node.js built-in) | — | Webhook signature verification |

---

## Why Selected

| Decision | Reason |
|---|---|
| Next.js API Routes over Express | No separate server needed, same deployment, simpler architecture |
| Razorpay over Stripe | India-focused, INR native, popular with Indian NGOs, free test mode |
| Supabase over Firebase | PostgreSQL (relational), built-in RLS, SQL support, free tier generous |
| Serverless over Server | No infrastructure management, auto-scaling, Vercel handles cold starts |

