## API Contract Reference

> Full request/response contracts defined in [PRD.mdc](../PRD.mdc) → Section 4

### Quick Reference
```
POST /api/create-order       → { amount, currency } → { order_id, amount, currency, key_id }
POST /api/verify-payment     → { razorpay_*, donor_* } → { success, donation_id }
POST /api/webhook/razorpay   → Razorpay event payload → 200 OK
GET  /api/admin/donations    → ?page&limit&search&date_* → { donations[], total, page, limit }
GET  /api/admin/stats        → → { total_donations, total_amount, donations_today, amount_today }
GET  /api/health             → → { status, timestamp, services }
```
